{"id":"22d2cd3fe9302513","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-fo-tc-normal-form.md","title":"FO(TC) 单闭包正规形式","display":"thm-fo-tc-normal-form — FO(TC) 单闭包正规形式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-fo-tc-normal-form","aliases":["29-thm-fo-tc-normal-form"],"display":"thm-fo-tc-normal-form — FO(TC) 单闭包正规形式","depends_on":["[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-fo-tc]]","[[29-df-formula]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Corollary 9.22, p.150, DjVu scan 165; Lemma 9.12, p.144, scan 159","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-fo-tc-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-fo-tc-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fo-tc-normal-form — FO(TC) 单闭包正规形式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98a7b2fe455fde6b\" href=\"?note=98a7b2fe455fde6b\" title=\"29-df-fo-tc\">29-df-fo-tc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 9.22, p.150, DjVu scan 165; Lemma 9.12, p.144, scan 159"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；保留符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 若已出现则为二元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\max\">\\(0,\\max\\)</span> 若已出现则为常量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)},0,\\max\\}\">\\(\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{&lt;^{(2)},0,\\max\\}\\)</span> 为兼容词汇合并。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\sigma]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\mathrm{FV}(\\Phi)\">\\(Z=\\mathrm{FV}(\\Phi)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinOrd}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\)</span> 在下面定义，明确要求至少两个元素及真正的最小、最大端点。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\sigma]\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\sigma]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；下式等价谓词同时量化模型与全个体赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |\\,|A|\\,|\\geq2\\land &lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\land\\forall a\\in|A|\\;((a=0^A\\lor(0^A,a)\\in&lt;^A)\\land(a=\\max^A\\lor(a,\\max^A)\\in&lt;^A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |\\,|A|\\,|\\geq2\\land &lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\land\\forall a\\in|A|\\;((a=0^A\\lor(0^A,a)\\in&lt;^A)\\land(a=\\max^A\\lor(a,\\max^A)\\in&lt;^A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\equiv_{TC,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;((A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\alpha[\\gamma])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\beta[\\gamma])).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\equiv_{TC,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;((A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\alpha[\\gamma])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\beta[\\gamma])).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bar0_k\\coloneqq(0)_{i=1}^k,\\qquad\\overline{\\max}_k\\coloneqq(\\max)_{i=1}^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bar0_k\\coloneqq(0)_{i=1}^k,\\qquad\\overline{\\max}_k\\coloneqq(\\max)_{i=1}^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\bar x,\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\\;\\left(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)|=2k\\land(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y))\\cap Z=\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)\\cup Z\\land\\Phi\\equiv_{TC,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}[\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\varphi](\\bar0_k,\\overline{\\max}_k)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\bar x,\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\\;\\left(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)|=2k\\land(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y))\\cap Z=\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)\\cup Z\\land\\Phi\\equiv_{TC,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,&lt;}[\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\varphi](\\bar0_k,\\overline{\\max}_k)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 9.22，印刷页 150，扫描页 165；§9.3 的更强量词自由体形式要求现成的后继关系。本条只要求 FO 体，因此后继可由序一阶定义。TC 取反身闭包；若端点在单元素结构中重合，裸闭包总真，故显式保留至少二元素条件，单元素输入另行处理。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-tc","status":"resolved","id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\sigma]$，$Z=\\mathrm{FV}(\\Phi)$；$\\mathrm{LinOrd}$ 见 [[29-df-ordering]]。$\\mathcal K_\\sigma$ 在下面定义，明确要求至少两个元素及真正的最小、最大端点。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=\\tau\\cup\\{<^{(2)},0,\\max\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"Z=\\mathrm{FV}(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinOrd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{FO(TC)}}[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\mid |\\,|A|\\,|\\geq2\\land <^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\land\\forall a\\in|A|\\;((a=0^A\\lor(0^A,a)\\in<^A)\\land(a=\\max^A\\lor(a,\\max^A)\\in<^A))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\equiv_{TC,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,<}\\beta\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall A\\in\\mathcal K_\\sigma\\;\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\;((A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\alpha[\\gamma])\\leftrightarrow(A\\models_{\\mathrm{TC}}\\beta[\\gamma])).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bar0_k\\coloneqq(0)_{i=1}^k,\\qquad\\overline{\\max}_k\\coloneqq(\\max)_{i=1}^k.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists\\bar x,\\bar y\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\sigma\\;\\left(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)|=2k\\land(\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y))\\cap Z=\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar y)\\cup Z\\land\\Phi\\equiv_{TC,\\sigma}^{\\geq2,<}[\\operatorname{TC}_{\\bar x,\\bar y}\\varphi](\\bar0_k,\\overline{\\max}_k)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2916,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-fo-lfp-normal-form]]、[[29-thm-fo-tc-normal-form]] — LFP 与 TC 范式"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-fo-tc-normal-form]]"}],"outgoing":["ac5c4072279f0088","98a7b2fe455fde6b","a3fa1d78e657e6a2","4f651c8d1bdc9a58"]}